      "Input Tax Credit (ITC): Claiming tax paid on input goods/services against output tax liability",
      "Reverse Charge Mechanism (RCM): Liability to pay tax shifts to the recipient (Railways for legal fees, goods transport)",
      "TDS under GST (Section 51): Mandatory 2% (1% CGST + 1% SGST or 2% IGST) deduction on contracts exceeding Rs. 2.5 Lakhs",
