      "Core ITIL Practices: Incident Management (restore service rapidly), Problem Management (identify and eliminate root cause, Known Error Database KEDB), Change Enablement (Change Advisory Board CAB, Standard/Normal/Emergency changes), Service Desk, Release Management.",
